<script setup lang="ts">import {onMounted,ref} from 'vue';import {useRouter} from 'vue-router';import {useStudies} from '../stores/studies';import {useResearch} from '../stores/research';import {useQuality} from '../stores/quality';import {useAuth} from '../stores/auth';import {useTask} from '../hooks/useTask';import {usePolling} from '../hooks/usePolling';import {date} from '../utils/format';import PageHeading from '../components/common/PageHeading.vue';import ErrorNotice from '../components/common/ErrorNotice.vue';import StatusBadge from '../components/common/StatusBadge.vue';import StudySelect from '../components/StudySelect.vue';const study=useStudies(),research=useResearch(),quality=useQuality(),auth=useAuth(),router=useRouter(),{error,busy,perform}=useTask(),name=ref('形成错位 · 全组秩比较'),alpha=ref(.05);onMounted(()=>perform(async()=>{await study.load();await Promise.all([research.loadRuns(),quality.load(study.selected)])}));usePolling(research.loadRuns);async function submit(){await research.queue({study_id:study.selected,name:name.value,alpha:alpha.value});name.value='形成等级 · 复核 '+new Date().toLocaleTimeString()}function read(id:number){research.select(id);router.push('/results')}const runsForStudy=()=>research.runs;</script><template><PageHeading no="03" title="冻结与运行" sub="提前写明alpha，冻结全部预定义工艺与等级，并冻结当时有效的排除依据；不按结果挑选组对。"/><ErrorNotice :error="error"/><div class="run-spread"><section><StudySelect/><div v-if="quality.notices.filter(n=>n.status==='active').length" class="method-note"><b>当前有效质量通告</b><p v-for="n in quality.notices.filter(n=>n.status==='active')" :key="n.id">#{{n.id}} {{n.title}} · {{n.items.length}}份试样失效：{{n.items.map(i=>i.specimen_code).slice(0,6).join('、')}}{{n.items.length>6?'…':''}}</p><p>新建检验会自动排除这些试样并冻结排除依据；已存在的依据若命中，立即停用且撤销不会恢复。</p></div><form class="run-form" @submit.prevent="perform(submit)"><label>检验名称<input v-model="name" required minLength="2" maxLength="140"/></label><label>预设显著性水平 α<input v-model.number="alpha" type="number" min="0.000001" max="0.999999" step="any" required/></label><div class="method-note"><b>一次合并排秩，两层阅读</b><p>KW：平均秩、并列修正C、渐近χ²。</p><p>Dunn：全部k(k−1)/2组对，共用合并秩方差，双侧正态渐近p与Holm校正。</p><p>无论总体p是否达到α，完整组对都保留。未拒绝不等于证明相同。</p></div><button class="primary" :disabled="busy||!auth.canEdit">{{busy?'提交中…':'冻结全组并排队 →'}}</button><p v-if="!auth.canEdit" class="muted">观察员可阅读；请分析员提交计算。</p></form><aside class="margin-note"><b>失效试样与样本不足</b><p>排除失效试样后若任一工艺少于5份，任务直接以失败态保留，写明哪几组不足；全部工艺仍保留，不悄悄删组，也不留一个不可见的成功结果。</p><p>全同值、非法等级、空组同样明确失败。排除依据随任务冻结，快照仍含原始等级与通告编号。</p></aside></section><section><h2 class="ruled-title">后台检验队列 <small>{{runsForStudy().length}}项</small></h2><div v-if="!runsForStudy().length" class="empty">尚无检验。核对来源与质量通告后，从左侧冻结一项完整研究。</div><article class="run-entry" v-for="r in runsForStudy()" :key="r.id"><div class="entry-line"><small>RUN {{r.id}}</small><StatusBadge :status="r.status"/></div><h3>{{r.name}}</h3><p>{{r.snapshot.treatments.length}}工艺 / {{r.snapshot.readings.length}}份进入计算 / 排除 {{r.exclusions.length}}份 / α {{r.alpha}}</p><p v-if="r.quality.invalidated" class="quality-banner"><b>依据已停用</b> {{r.quality.invalidated_reason||('命中通告 #'+r.quality.invalidated_by_notice_ids.join('、#'))}}<span>撤销通告不能恢复此依据；需新建检验。</span></p><small>{{date(r.created_at)}}</small><p v-if="r.error" class="error-text">{{r.error}}</p><button v-if="r.status==='completed'&&!r.quality.invalidated" class="text-link" @click="read(r.id)">打开完整检验结果 ↗</button><button v-else-if="r.status==='completed'" class="text-link" @click="read(r.id)">查看已停用结果留档 ↗</button><p v-if="['queued','running'].includes(r.status)" class="working">队列每2.5秒刷新，离开页面不影响后台执行。</p></article></section></div></template>
